Date: Wed, 25 Nov 2026 20:04:43 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] rawdanger-recomp v0.9.6: graphics views and stats in Settings
 > Debug

Picture shown: the game's, the AO alone, the depth (in metres, log grey)
or the wet look's capsules, drawn by the AO pass (word 63). Stats on
screen: FPS, CPU / GPU, memory, scene and camera, wetness, the view and
the frame, in the keys' place once a second.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01QNLFPekqhcU2dj7B3Utmea
